  questionType: 2
  questionText: Type the missing keyword to add a new clue to the clues table.
  code: 'Table: clues

    +----+----------+--------+

    | id | item     | room  
    |

    +----+----------+--------+

    |  1 | Backpack | Hall   |

    |  2 |
    Note     | Office |

    |  3 | Map      | Hall   |

    +----+----------+--------+


    INSERT
    ___ clues (item, room)

    VALUES (''Flashlight'', ''Garage'');'
  answerFormat: 1
  choices: []
