  acceptedAnswers:
  - INTO
  caseSensitive: 0
  explanation: New rows are added with  INSERT INTO table (columns) VALUES (values); 
    The values must be in the same order as the column list.
  hint: 'INSERT ____ clues: the missing word means "inside".'
